# Sitecore (App Router + Cache Components)

- **Cached reads:** `getSitecorePage`, `getSitecoreDictionary`, `getSitecoreErrorPage` in `src/lib/cache/` (`use cache` + `cacheTag`)
- **Preview/editing:** `draftMode()` + `client.getPreview` / `getDesignLibraryData` directly — **never** wrap preview in `use cache`
- **OSR:** `POST /api/revalidate` with `sc:route` / `sc:item` / `sc:dict` tags; optional `SITECORE_REVALIDATE_SECRET`
- **Routing:** `src/app/[site]/[locale]/[[...path]]/page.tsx`; `setRequestLocale`; `setCachedPageParams` / `getCachedPageParams` for SSG-safe not-found
- **Fields:** `<Text>`, `<RichText>`, `<Image>`, `<Link>`; validate before render
- **Config:** keep SDK dictionary cache **disabled** in `sitecore.config.ts`

